hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1123","Chapter on the share of the horseman and the foot-soldier, 1162 - al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani narrated to us, he said: Abu Mu'awiyah al-Darir narrated to us, he said: Ubayd Allah narrated to us, from Nafi', from Ibn Umar (may Allah be pleased with them): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) assigned to a man and his horse three shares: one share for him and two shares for his horse."
